    "intro": "Applications should feel physical and tactile: cotton menus, checkered roast boxes, handheld cups, canvas awnings, posters, and dusk interiors.",
    "menuFlatlay": "Tactile cotton menu — 320gsm sheet with brass corner clip, ceramic demitasse, kouign-amann, and debossed pulp coaster.",
    "parlourService": "Parlour service — checkered roast gable box, fluted glass, and brass tray in dusk light.",
    "packagingBoxes": "Roast & pastry boxes — Warm Timber checkerboard stock and debossed cotton labels.",
    "takeawayCup": "Handheld takeaway cup: sculpted crema wordmark wraps warm Steamed Milk stock against sunlit ceramic tiles.",
    "storefrontSignage": "Storefront signage: woven Warm Timber canvas awning and hanging blade banner over fluted dusk glass."
